    "content": {
     "header": "Ausstattung",
     "subheader": "",
     "headerLayout": 0,
     "headerPosition": "",
     "headerLink": "",
     "type": "mask_list",
     "title": "The timelessness<br>\r\nof rock",
     "text": "",
     "listitems": [
      {
       "uid": "9",
       "title": "At the origins",
       "text": "<p>This spacious suite features 904 sq ft of space and a 161 sq ft balcony. The light and atmosphere of the interior are shaped by the powerful surroundings of nature and mountains, while an open fireplace creates warmth and cosiness.</p><ul><li><span>sleeping area with kingsize bed</span></li><li><span>open fireplace</span></li><li><span>separate sleeping area with 1.40m bed in the living area</span></li><li><span>daybed, cosy nook with dining/games table</span></li><li><span>bathroom with rain shower</span></li><li><span>organic body care by March - made in austria</span></li><li><span>freestanding bathtub</span></li><li><span>161 sq ft balcony with star-gazer’s daybed</span></li><li><span>tea and coffee bar</span></li><li><span>minibar</span></li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "10",
       "title": "Nature cinema",
       "text": "<p>The suites have been intentionally designed without a television: Nothing distracts more from the abundance and magnificence of nature as it stands before your very eyes. The suites are equipped with:</p><ul><li>Your personal pair of woollen socks</li><li><span>Wi-Fi</span></li><li><span>Record player and wireless speaker</span></li><li><span>Useful items for the mountain</span></li></ul>"
      },
      {
       "uid": "23",
       "title": "All-In-Service",
       "text": "<p>eriro is located in the middle of an expanse of Alpine pastures and forests, a world away from everyday life and the noise of the valley. It is out of this unique positioning that our Alpine hideaway was conceived, offering you the following inclusive services:</p><ul><li>all meals, including food and drinks (excl. selected premium spirits)</li><li><span>parking lot and shuttle service&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>mountain cable car tickets or ski pass, depending on the season&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>mountain experiences including tour guide&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>bikes and mountain equipment such as snowshoes or hiking poles&nbsp;</span></li><li><span>spa facilities including pools, saunas, terrace, and relaxation and sound rooms</span></li></ul><p><a href=\"/en/all-in-service/\">More about the All-In Service</a></p>"
      }
     ]
    }
   },
